<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:40:41 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>地堡谈话：劳动节周末版</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-labor-day-weekend-edition-4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;祝大家度过一个愉快而轻松的周末！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-labor-day-weekend-edition-4"&gt;后邦克谈话：劳动节周末版&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:23:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-labor-day-weekend-edition-4</guid></item><item><title>美国空军希望购买 MQ-9“死神”后继机，每架成本仅为 1000 万美元</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/usaf-wants-mq-9-reaper-successor-at-a-fraction-of-the-cost-at-10m-each</link><description>&lt;p&gt;美国空军对新无人机制定了雄心勃勃的成本和进度目标，以接替遭受重大损失的 MQ-9 机队。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/usaf-wants-mq-9-reaper-successor-at-a-fraction-of-the-cost-at-10m-each"&gt;美国空军希望以 1000 万美元的成本购买 MQ-9“死神”后继机的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 23:43:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/usaf-wants-mq-9-reaper-successor-at-a-fraction-of-the-cost-at-10m-each</guid></item><item><title>亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰在泰国期间正在接受急需的擦洗</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/uss-abraham-lincoln-is-getting-a-badly-needed-scrubbing-while-in-thailand</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这艘船在海上航行了 286 天后，于本周早些时候驶入泰国，上面布满了铁锈和藻类。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/uss-abraham-lincoln-is-getting-a-badly-needed-scrubbing-while-in-thailand"&gt;亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰在泰国进行急需的清洗后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 23:03:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/uss-abraham-lincoln-is-getting-a-badly-needed-scrubbing-while-in-thailand</guid></item><item><title>中国巨大的WZ-X隐形无人机奇怪的机翼配置被证实</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-huge-wz-x-stealth-drones-strange-wing-configuration-confirmed</link><description>&lt;p&gt;WZ-X 机载的新照片让我们更清楚地了解该飞机独特的机翼设计。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-huge-wz-x-stealth-drones-strange-wing-configuration-confirmed"&gt;中国巨型WZ-X隐形无人机奇怪的机翼配置确认的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 22:42:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-huge-wz-x-stealth-drones-strange-wing-configuration-confirmed</guid></item><item><title>美国空军寻求高射炮来保护其海外基地</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/u-s-air-force-seeks-anti-aircraft-guns-to-protect-its-overseas-bases</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在提出反无人机和反巡航导弹枪的需求之际，空军正努力在其前沿基地承担更多防空职责。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/u-s-air-force-seeks-anti-aircraft-guns-to-protect-its-overseas-bases"&gt;美国空军寻求高射炮来保护其海外基地的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:04:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/u-s-air-force-seeks-anti-aircraft-guns-to-protect-its-overseas-bases</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯无人机如何迫使乌克兰停放 M1 艾布拉姆斯坦克</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/how-russian-drones-forced-ukraine-to-park-its-m1-abrams-tanks</link><description>&lt;p&gt;经过两次代价高昂的行动后，乌克兰第 425“斯卡拉”团停止部署 M1A1，但他们并没有失去对主战坦克的全部信心。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/how-russian-drones-forced-ukraine-to-park-its-m1-abrams-tanks"&gt;俄罗斯无人机如何迫使乌克兰停放 M1 艾布拉姆斯坦克的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 17:12:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/how-russian-drones-forced-ukraine-to-park-its-m1-abrams-tanks</guid></item><item><title>正在研究三艘外国护卫舰是否可能服役于美国海军</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/the-three-foreign-frigates-being-studied-for-possible-u-s-navy-service</link><description>&lt;p&gt;现代日本、韩国和土耳其护卫舰设计已成为满足日益紧迫的海军需求的可能竞争者。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/the-three-foreign-frigates-being-studied-for-possible-u-s-navy-service"&gt;正在研究三艘外国护卫舰是否可能服役于美国海军的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:02:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/the-three-foreign-frigates-being-studied-for-possible-u-s-navy-service</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰海上无人机首次袭击俄罗斯黑海度假胜地索契</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/ukrainian-sea-drones-strike-russian-black-sea-resort-town-of-sochi-for-the-first-time</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌克兰局势报告：对索契港口的袭击凸显了基辅无人船攻击活动的范围不断扩大。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/ukrainian-sea-drones-strike-russian-black-sea-resort-town-of-sochi-for-the-first-time"&gt;乌克兰海上无人机首次袭击俄罗斯黑海度假胜地&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;索契&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:31:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/ukrainian-sea-drones-strike-russian-black-sea-resort-town-of-sochi-for-the-first-time</guid></item><item><title>首架驻扎日本的美国空军 F-15EX 离开波音圣路易斯工厂</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/first-usaf-f-15ex-to-be-based-in-japan-departs-boeings-st-louis-plant</link><description>&lt;p&gt;第一架飞往日本基地的 F-15EX 正值该计划努力解决未来的保障问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/first-usaf-f-15ex-to-be-based-in-japan-departs-boeings-st-louis-plant"&gt;首架以日本为基地的美国空军 F-15EX 离开波音圣路易斯工厂后，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:00:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/first-usaf-f-15ex-to-be-based-in-japan-departs-boeings-st-louis-plant</guid></item><item><title>无人机检测如何发展以应对更小、更快的群体威胁</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sponsored-content/how-drone-detection-is-evolving-to-counter-smaller-faster-and-swarm-threats</link><description>&lt;p&gt;品牌内容：Leonardo DRS 解释了战术雷达如何构成分层反 UAS 威胁检测系统的核心要素。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sponsored-content/how-drone-detection-is-evolving-to-counter-smaller-faster-and-swarm-threats"&gt;无人机检测如何演进以应对更小、更快的群体威胁&lt;/a&gt;一文首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 17:46:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sponsored-content/how-drone-detection-is-evolving-to-counter-smaller-faster-and-swarm-threats</guid></item></channel></rss>